      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Yup, same over here, in the SDK it works fine, but in game it does not.\n(The affected SDK is the \"VRCSDK3-AVATAR-2022.08.29.20.48_Public.unitypackage\")\nAnd BTW, I have tried uploading avatars that do work, and with the new SDK, they break",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
