      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm having this issue too. Upon updating the SDK, an avatar that previously worked on upload is now unable to have any hand animations. Instead, the hand does the animation displayed in this picture.\nUpdate:\n \nI removed the locomotion controller from my avatar and the hands started working. Upon further troubleshooting, I found out that the locomotion animations applied transforms to the fingers. I removed these finger animation properties and now everything is working like normal.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
